Package: ferromodeR
Title: R Bindings for Ferromode
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ferromode", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@ferromode.dev")
Description: R bindings for the Ferromode signal processing library.
    Provides empirical mode decomposition (EMD, EEMD, CEEMD, CEEMDAN,
    ICEEMDAN), variational mode decomposition (VMD), and multivariate
    methods (MEMD, NA-MEMD) via Rust bindings.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust)
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
